# Merge gate for the capz-loop automation (see .claude/skills/capz-loop).
#
# The ruleset "protect main" requires a Code Owner review, so a PR touching any
# path below cannot merge until @wadjakorn approves it — these are the areas an
# agent on a headless Linux box cannot verify (real OS capture, permissions,
# hotkeys, persistence, privacy, release plumbing). Everything else merges on
# green checks. Approvals are dismissed on push, so they bind to the head SHA.
# The owner is on the ruleset bypass list and can still push directly.

# Native shell: capture, shortcuts, windows, capabilities, updater config.
/src-tauri/                                   @wadjakorn

# Helper windows that only exist on desktop.
/src/app/overlay/                             @wadjakorn
/src/app/ring/                                @wadjakorn
/src/app/scroll-hud/                          @wadjakorn
/src/app/scroll-guide/                        @wadjakorn

